      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:08:27.395085Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Documentation: Julien Palard",
      "source_hash": 6301916204419109592,
      "context_hash": 9232746289323080539,
      "translation": "문서화: Julien Palard",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:08:27.395085Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "3.7 Lifespan",
      "source_hash": 8720325798361171037,
      "context_hash": 5940569423537107656,
      "translation": "3.7 수명",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:08:27.395085Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "3.7 will receive `bugfix updates <https://devguide.python.org/devcycle/#maintenance-branches>`_ approximately every 3 months for about 24 months.",
      "source_hash": 9225008077230853017,
      "context_hash": 8939661282871890708,
      "translation": "3.7은 약 24개월 동안 대략 3개월마다 `버그 수정 업데이트 <https://devguide.python.org/devcycle/#maintenance-branches>`_\\ 를 받습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:08:27.395085Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Sometime after the release of 3.8.0 final, a final 3.7 bugfix update will be released.",
      "source_hash": 9368069420683323620,
      "context_hash": 9620689221875454303,
      "translation": "3.8.0 최종 릴리스 이후 어느 시점에 최종 3.7 버그 수정 업데이트가 릴리스됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:08:27.395086Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "After that, it is expected that `security updates <https://devguide.python.org/devcycle/#security-branches>`_ (source only) will be released as needed until 5 years after the release of 3.7 final, so until approximately 2023-06.",
      "source_hash": 15812479870649578671,
      "context_hash": 9840831533055468686,
      "translation": "그 이후에는 3.7 최종 릴리스 후 5년이 될 때까지, 즉 대략 2023-06까지 필요에 따라 `보안 업데이트 <https://devguide.python.org/devcycle/#security-branches>`_\\ 가 (소스만) 릴리스될 것으로 예상됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:08:27.395086Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "As of 2023-06-27, 3.7 has reached the `end-of-life phase <https://devguide.python.org/devcycle/#end-of-life-branches>`_ of its release cycle. 3.7.17 was the final security release.",
      "source_hash": 7033542142025425558,
      "context_hash": 13289930746934372198,
      "translation": "2023-06-27 기준으로 3.7은 릴리스 주기의 `수명 종료 단계 <https://devguide.python.org/devcycle/#end-of-life-branches>`_\\ 에 도달했습니다. 3.7.17은 최종 보안 릴리스였습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:08:27.395086Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "The code base for 3.7 is now frozen and no further updates will be provided nor issues of any kind will be accepted on the bug tracker.",
      "source_hash": 17143474132271907341,
      "context_hash": 16461662981779832632,
      "translation": "3.7의 코드베이스는 이제 동결되었으며 더 이상의 업데이트는 제공되지 않고 버그 추적기에서 어떤 종류의 이슈도 접수되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:08:27.395086Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
